WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:02.270
Chara-su!

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:04.100
Is everyone shugo-peppy today?

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.020
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.710
The next thirty minutes is chock full of shugo-cute anime!

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.190
We hope you totally enjoy them!

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.650
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.200
Unlock!

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.450
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.960
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.760
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.630
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:27.480
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.360
you're like a dream.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.210
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.100
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.940
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.740
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:40.540
Whenever I start something new

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.250
I get really excited,

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.920
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:51.060
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:58.700
I think it'd be nice if I could just be honest with myself.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.490
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:06.620
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:11.240
It's party time!

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:14.990
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.730
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:22.930
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:26.140
It's party time!

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:29.850
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:33.360
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.990
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.780
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:50.070
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:52.470
"The Golden Pacifier."

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:57.820
Hey, what should we play today?

00:01:57.820 --> 00:02:00.140
How about baby-dechu?

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:00.990
Huh?

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:04.260
We could all suck on pacifiers and...

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:05.610
What it is-dechu?

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:08.600
You always have a pacifier in your mouth, don't you?

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.430
Have you ever...

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:12.270
...taken it out?

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:16.180
I wonder what Pepe would look like without her pacifier!

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:18.590
Come on, give it a try!

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:20.070
I-I-I can't-dechu!

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.330
Why not?

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:22.850
Just for a bit!

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:24.010
Over here, over here!

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.450
Don't-dechu!

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:28.830
Oh no! Pepe-chan's pacifier!

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:34.770
Sorry, Pepe.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:36.890
Now what'll we do?

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:47.520
Which pacifier did you drop?

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:50.970
This normal one? Or this golden one?

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.370
That one-dechu.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:57.650
I see. To reward your honesty, I will give you this golden pacifier.

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:00.230
Fare thee well.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:06.900
Good for you!

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.720
Honesty is always rewarded.

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:10.160
I don't like this-dechu!

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:13.860
I want <i>my</i> pacifier-dechu!

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:19.140
Then, why not try it again?

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:22.960
This time, drop the golden pacifier into the pond.

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:23.790
Great idea!

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:26.670
And then, if you answer honestly that you dropped the golden pacifier...

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:28.270
You'll get your old pacifier back!

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.380
Try it, Pepe!

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.800
Which pacifier did you dr-

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.250
That one-dechu!

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:45.780
I see.

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:50.840
How dare you purposefully drop the golden pacifier I blessed you with!

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:53.270
Fare. Thee. Well.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:57.470
Well, that didn't work.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:04:01.530
True. It was mean to drop it on purpose.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:07.540
This whole mess is your fault-dechu!

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.430
Sorry!

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:12.540
I'll get you for this-dechu!

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:12.940
See you again!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.010
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:17.860
We'll start introducing people today!

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:21.110
First up is... Hinamori Amu!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:25.740
Amu's the Joker of Seiyo Academy's Guardians.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:31.290
She's a sixth-grader with a cool & spicy attitude everyone admires!

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:34.380
But what's she <i>really</i> like?

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.620
Continuing, the second person is...

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.340
Hotori Tadase!

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:57.480
Tadase is the Guardians' King's Chair.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:02.570
He's in sixth grade, is kind and slightly shy, and is totally popular with all the girls!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:06.200
I wonder how his relationship with Amu-chan will evolve?

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:19.550
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara Encyclopedia introductions each week!

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.110
Look forward to it!

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:26.760
Shugo, shugo! Egg Battle!

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:30.090
Today we'll play "match the answer" with the Character Cubes!

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:32.880
We'll play a Shugo Chara Character song.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:38.090
If you know who's singing it, arrange that person's face on the cube!

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:40.090
So here's the question:

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:43.100
Who do you think is singing this song?

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:46.920
Figures!

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:48.810
They knew right away!

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:52.660
But who'll be able to arrange the cube first?

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:54.680
I've got three squares.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:56.490
Only one left.

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:58.100
Shugo-fast!

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.420
Heart's really good at this game.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.800
What's with this?

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:04.120
The other two are struggling along...

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:06.240
Heart's got a big lead!

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.920
Spade's really having a hard time today.

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:11.360
I finished!

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:13.880
Okay, Heart, what's the answer?

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:15.190
Utau-chan!

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:17.100
Correct!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:20.260
Utau-chan was the singer!

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:22.490
Today's winner is Amulet Heart!

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:24.470
Do your best next time!

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:33.820
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:36.520
"The Twin Guardian Characters?"

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:45.110
Hey. Nadeshiko and Nagihiko are twins, right?

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:46.120
Yes...

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:47.980
What makes you ask?

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:49.170
Then that means...

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:50.950
...Temari and Rhythm...

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:53.200
...are twins as well?

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:56.920
Is it true that twins can do anything perfectly in sync?

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:58.240
I've heard that.

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:02.130
They can talk or move exactly at the same time!

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:05.220
You two can do that, right? Right?

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:08.520
Um, except we're not actually...

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:13.850
If we tell them the truth, we might reveal that Nadeshiko and Nagihiko aren't twins!

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:14.890
Oh, right!

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:15.800
So what should we do?

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:18.160
What are you whispering about?

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.470
Oh, um, nothing!

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:23.700
Yep, perfectly in sync!

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:24.810
Right...

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:28.900
Awesome! Do it again!

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:30.210
Um...

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:31.840
I know! They should play rock-paper-scissors!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:32.950
Huh?

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.560
They'll tie every time!

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:36.550
For sure!

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:38.460
R-Right...

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:40.310
W-We'll try it.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:42.760
All right!

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:44.910
Ready, set, go!

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:46.700
It's a tie! Go!

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.560
It's a tie! Go!

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.360
It's a tie! Go!

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:51.170
Go!

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:52.100
Go!

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:55.290
Go!

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:57.190
They tied each time!

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:01.780
I wonder what it'd be like if you danced with each other!

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:04.090
I bet they'd be a perfect pair at that, too!

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:05.710
Yeah, 'cause they're twins!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.680
P-Perhaps...

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:09.340
W-We'll try it.

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.500
The two of us be twins, dokki doki!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.970
When we dance together, it's a sight to see!

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:24.150
With Temari...

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:25.300
And Rhythm...

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:27.110
You get Temarhythm!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.130
Yo!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.040
Totally twins!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:33.170
Not a breath out of sync!

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:38.310
It's not necessarily true that Guardian Characters have to be twins like their bearers.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.400
Now that you mention it...

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.640
That's true.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:44.610
They <i>were</i> born at different times and all.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:48.240
I suppose our efforts were unnecessary...

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:50.470
We tried so hard for nothing...

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:54.160
But they really do seem like twins!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.970
See you again!

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:01.560
Coming up next is Shugo Chara!!! Dokki Doki!

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:04.520
Today's episode is titled "The Miraculous Character Change!"

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.810
Amu-chan's gonna Character Change like crazy!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:08.860
I can't wait!

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:11.840
Dokki Doki will start right after the commercial break!

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:26.850
What's really important?

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:32.900
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:40.160
and even if they don't know it, everyone has one in their heart.

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:51.500
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:56.220
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian Characters and X Characters...

00:09:56.220 --> 00:10:00.590
They're all precious things.

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:04.760
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:06.290
Everything'll be okay.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:09.350
Because even if you feel lost,

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:12.780
you're not alone.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:14.940
We'll always be together.

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:17.580
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:20.610
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:23.790
Open Heart, now!

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:25.450
You can see the eggs, right?

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:30.460
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:36.300
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:38.520
I'll be counting on you!

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:49.010
We haven't walked home together in a while.

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:49.920
The Miraculous Character Change

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:50.670
You're quite right.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:52.940
Everything feels so calm lately.

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:54.630
Delightfully calm.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.380
You lot are much too relaxed!

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:59.880
No way, you need to chill out a bit, Kiseki.

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:04.050
Yeah! You should Character Change to be more like Su!

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.660
Splendidly calm!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:09.670
An e-mail?

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.880
It's from Ikuto!

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:13.750
From Ikuto-niisan?

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:15.660
He sends a lot to me as well.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:20.460
But most of the pictures aren't taken very well.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:22.880
Amu-chan's are the same.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:26.620
Honestly, someone teach Yoru how to hold a camera properly.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.150
Now, let him be.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:31.170
Scoop-nya!

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:34.340
By the way, Amu-chan.

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:35.840
What?

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:38.570
Would you like to go to the park with me?

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:40.650
You mean...

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:43.010
He wants to go on a date!

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:44.720
Well?

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.220
Sure, I don't mind...

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.670
Oh, be honest.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.890
You're over the moon.

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:52.310
Quiet, you!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.210
Okay!

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:59.990
Hmm, it's no use. Maybe I'm no good at this.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:03.580
Character Change: From a girl who's not honest with herself to one who is!

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:05.550
Hop! Step! Jump!

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:07.230
Tadase-kun!

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:08.680
You're sparkling!

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:10.330
As wonderfully as ever today!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.490
Cool!

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:15.670
Character Change?

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:19.660
Right! What you saw before was Amu-chan after Character Changing with me.

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:23.140
Hey, Ran! What the heck are you making me do in front of Tadase-kun?!

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:24.990
I'm beat...

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:27.010
Are you okay, Amu-chan?

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:28.680
Character Change!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:31.510
Okey-dokey!

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:33.690
Just spiffy!

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:36.020
Wow, she's totally different!

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:38.040
And that's a Character Change.

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.580
Are you all right, Amu-chan?

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:43.650
Anyone with a Guardian Character can Character Change.

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:46.730
So you can do it, too?

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:48.070
But of course!

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:49.240
Allow me to demonstrate!

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.940
Don't!

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:56.150
I merely wished to show her Tadase's grand visage!

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:58.620
Rikka-chan, Amu-chan can Character Change with me as well.

00:12:58.620 --> 00:12:59.990
Yeah? What's she like then?

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:01.370
I wanna see!

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:05.130
We are now going to bake a cake!

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:06.690
Yay!

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:08.030
Why?

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:09.350
Go with it!

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.710
Here, Amu-chan.

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:12.350
Character Change!

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:16.310
Right! Let's whip up a scrumptious cake!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:20.750
You can leave the cooking, cleaning, and housework to me!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.450
Her personality changed again!

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:26.180
Awesome!

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:28.030
That's not all.

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:32.140
Chip, Syrup, Whip!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:40.610
This is so cool!

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:44.430
Save me!

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:46.030
Character Change!

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:48.330
Draw, Drew, Drawn!

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:58.310
Wow, incredible!

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:05.720
I've had enough!

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:08.000
Amu-chan, calm down!

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:09.220
Dia!

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:12.320
Hey, what's Dia's Character Change like?

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:13.600
Good question!

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:15.900
We've never seen it before, have we?

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.070
I wanna see!

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:18.660
Yeah, show us!

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:23.420
Character Change!

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:38.410
That's it?

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:40.920
I was sort of expecting something more.

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:43.100
What a letdown...

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:44.130
What?

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:53.480
Have you been waiting long?

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:55.610
No, not at all.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.570
So, Amu-chan...

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:58.080
Yes?

00:14:58.380 --> 00:14:59.520
I love you.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:04.380
There it is! Tadase-kun's frontal attack!

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.940
He promised to say he loved her every day!

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:09.190
However, he hasn't said it recently.

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:10.930
Zip it, you guys!

00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:13.670
Where did that come from?

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:14.810
Sorry...

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:18.890
But we're finally alone, so I wanted to make sure I said it.

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:21.570
Is that why you invited me here?

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:23.520
I love you, Amu-chan.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:28.750
Amu-chan, your face is on fire!

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.030
Enough!

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:32.160
This calls for a Character Change!

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:37.590
Oh boy! I'm so happy!

00:15:37.590 --> 00:15:38.830
Amu-chan?

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.960
So very happy!

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:43.710
She's spinning more than usual!

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:47.010
So cool!

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:49.170
Someone stop me!

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:56.300
She even stuck the Super Ultra C!

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.490
I'm dizzy...

00:15:58.490 --> 00:15:59.730
Our castle...

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:04.720
I'm sorry!

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:05.900
What should I do?

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.770
I'll handle this!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:08.900
Character Change!

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:19.500
Wow, awesome!

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.140
Sorry about before.

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:22.960
Well done, Miki!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:23.760
Ahem!

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:26.710
Naturally. Arts and crafts are my forte.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:30.370
Did you say arts and crafts?

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:33.980
I'm borrowing Miki-chan!

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:37.350
Wait a second, Rikka!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.720
Arts and crafts homework?

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:45.020
They told us to make whatever we like out of clay,

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:47.020
but I really suck.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.630
Oh...

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:51.800
So Character Change with me!

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:55.550
I want to use clay really well, like Amu-senpai!

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:57.220
That's impossible.

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:58.180
Why?

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:01.730
You can only Character Change with your own Guardian Character.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:04.470
Huh? That's not fair!

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:06.920
It's not a question of fair...

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:08.200
Rikka.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:09.420
Amu-senpai?

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:12.010
You can't rely on Character Changing.

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:19.390
I'll help you, so let's work at it together.

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:30.740
I just can't do it.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:32.320
Now, don't give up.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.700
But...

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:37.110
You're full of potential, Rikka-chan.

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:42.830
Amu-chan's Character Changes are all forms of who she'd like to be.

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:49.050
They are who she has the potential to be someday.

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:53.200
That's why Amu-chan tries her best at everything she does, without giving up.

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.300
She tries her best?

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:08.150
It's important that you do the same, Rikka-chan.

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.490
Amu-senpai, I'm gonna try my best!

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:27.450
All righty then!

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:29.360
Here I go!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:39.260
I think she has a slightly wrong impression of what "try your best" means...

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.220
Ta-da!

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.580
Finished!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:43.650
A catfish?

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.110
You like...

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:46.450
...catfish?

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:47.960
Not bad!

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.500
I keep one as a pet at home!

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:53.730
It's an adorable little catfish.

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:56.070
It is?

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:58.170
You did great, Rikka.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:00.240
Hey, Amu-senpai?

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:05.620
If I gave birth to a Guardian Character, I could Character Change, too, right?

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:09.270
Awesome!

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:12.070
I wonder what my Character Change would be like...

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:13.300
Hyperactive!

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:14.400
Irresponsible!

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:15.890
Someone who gets bored easily!

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:16.800
Hey!

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:19.300
I'm not like that at all, jeez!

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:20.880
Clueless, huh?

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:21.390
Thank you, Tadase-kun.

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.140
Totally oblivious!

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.600
You helped motivate Rikka.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.600
Shaddup! I'm not like that!

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.760
I didn't do anything.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:30.470
She saw how you shined as you worked hard, is all.

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:39.790
Tadase-kun really is just like a prince.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.510
What?

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:45.370
You just said that aloud, Amu-chan.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.470
Oh, shoot! How humiliating!

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:49.520
And you called him a prince...

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:51.130
Crap!

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:53.410
That was close.

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:56.530
What about a prince?

00:19:58.530 --> 00:19:59.720
Character Change!

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:02.020
Don't!

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:06.100
I am no mere prince!

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:10.060
Standing at the pinnacle of the citizenry, I rule the Earth!

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:12.680
I am the King of Kings!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:17.320
You there, minion!

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:18.800
Yes?!

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:26.140
Step up your efforts!

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:27.240
R-Right!

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:31.260
At this rate, you'll never become a full-fledged Guardian!

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:38.740
Character Changes are scary!

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:40.370
Tadase-kun...

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:44.720
It's time for Guardian Egg Fortune-Telling!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:48.270
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:53.230
Which egg will be the lucky one?

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:59.260
Guardian Egg Romance Fortune!

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:01.730
First, for those who chose Dia:

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:02.760
Four Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:04.290
Super lucky!

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:05.750
They might just feel the same!

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:08.490
Now's your chance!

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:08.490
Ask your friends to play Cupid!

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:12.650
Su's egg gets three Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:15.010
Dress up cute before you head out!

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:15.010
You might run in to the person you like!

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:16.770
Miki's egg gets two Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:19.360
Could it be love at first sight?

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:19.360
Have the courage to speak up!

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:22.560
Finally, for those who chose Ran's egg:

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:26.030
Um, you get, um... one Shugoluck Star.

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:27.400
A rival appears?

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:32.430
Instead of fighting, cooperate and share info on your crush!

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:35.140
Your lucky item is a television!

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:40.860
Shugo Chara Egg! Amulet Diamond Audition Report!

00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:48.780
Everyone who passed the first round gathered together from all over the country!

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:53.120
The second audition for Amulet Diamond has finally begun!

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:55.910
The crucial interview portion is underway!

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:58.080
Let's take a peek.

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:00.990
Why did you take this audition?

00:22:00.990 --> 00:22:01.920
I like to sing,

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:06.130
and I like Dia, so I figured I'd try.

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:07.740
What do you like about Shugo Chara?

00:22:07.740 --> 00:22:09.760
I like it because it makes me smile.

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:16.270
I think the parts of the story about the Academy are interesting. That's why I watch.

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:18.520
What do you want to be when you grow up?

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:22.960
I want to be an actress who can sing and dance.

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:28.830
Everyone is doing their best to express their feelings!

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:31.280
Next, they'll try to impress the judges with their singing!

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:32.660
Good luck!

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:37.650
Wow, even I'm getting nervous.

00:22:37.650 --> 00:22:40.460
We can feel how hard everyone's working.

00:22:40.760 --> 00:22:43.700
Stay tuned for next week's Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:43.700 --> 00:22:44.770
Lock on:

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:46.940
Open Heart!

00:22:46.940 --> 00:22:48.500
Bye-bye!

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:58.050
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.710
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's put our hands together! That's what I wanna do!

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.290
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:34.100
Now put your hands together! It's what you should do!

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:40.080
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.480
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:52.690
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.780
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:09.100
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.190
Bravo!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.650
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
